{#- Phrases every consent text shares. A purpose template imports this with context.
    `recipient` is the offer's recipient (party_by_alias[offer.recipients.recipient]);
    the holder of the readings is the community's grid operator, `dso`. -#}
{% import 'macros/durations.j2' as durations %}

{#- How a member knows the recipient: its display name if it has one, else its short name. -#}
{% macro name(party) %}{{ party.get('display_name') or party.short }}{% endmacro %}

{#- What the recipient does for the community, when that is why the member knows it.
    Empty for a recipient with no such role. -#}
{% macro role(lang, party) %}
{%- if party.kind == 'platform-operator' -%}
{{ 'gestisce la piattaforma digitale della comunità' if lang == 'it' else "operates the community's digital platform" }}
{%- endif -%}
{% endmacro %}

{#- The readings an offer covers, from its resolution and coverage. `form` 'full' is the
    access offers' wording, 'brief' the wording of the uses, in brackets. -#}
{% macro readings(lang, offer, form) %}
{%- set step = offer.resolution -%}
{%- set back = offer.coverage.retrospective -%}
{%- set ahead = offer.coverage.prospective -%}
{%- if lang == 'it' and form == 'full' -%}
l'energia prelevata e quella immessa in rete, a intervalli di {{ durations.span(step, 'it') }}, per i {{ durations.before(back, 'it') }} e per {{ durations.after(ahead, 'it') }} a questo consenso
{%- elif lang == 'it' -%}
energia prelevata e immessa, a intervalli di {{ durations.span(step, 'it') }}, per i {{ durations.before(back, 'it') }} e {{ durations.after(ahead, 'it') }} a questo consenso
{%- elif form == 'full' -%}
the energy I draw from and feed into the grid, in {{ durations.span(step, 'en', true) }} intervals, for the {{ durations.before(back, 'en') }} and the {{ durations.after(ahead, 'en') }} this consent
{%- else -%}
energy drawn and fed in, in {{ durations.span(step, 'en', true) }} intervals, for the {{ durations.before(back, 'en') }} and the {{ durations.after(ahead, 'en') }} this consent
{%- endif -%}
{% endmacro %}

{#- That the consent is free and where it is withdrawn; the purpose adds what withdrawal
    does, after a colon, or ends the sentence. -#}
{% macro optional(lang) %}
{%- if lang == 'it' -%}
Il consenso è facoltativo e non è una condizione per essere socio. Posso revocarlo in ogni momento dall'app della comunità, alla pagina «Condivisione dei dati»
{%- else -%}
This consent is optional and is not a condition of membership. I can withdraw it at any time in the community app, on the "Data sharing" page
{%- endif -%}
{% endmacro %}

{#- What withdrawal does to an access (no later release) or to a use (no new processing). -#}
{% macro after_withdrawal(lang, kind) %}
{%- if kind == 'release' -%}
{{ 'dopo la revoca i miei dati non sono più compresi nei rilasci successivi' if lang == 'it' else 'after that, my data is left out of every later release' }}
{%- else -%}
{{ 'dopo la revoca i miei dati non sono più usati in nuove elaborazioni' if lang == 'it' else 'after that, my data is not used in any new processing' }}
{%- endif -%}
{% endmacro %}
